<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Oct copper output rises.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Oct copper output rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>BELGRADE, Jan 24 (Reuter ) - The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV NON-FERROUS ORES     (Oct 96)  (Sept 96)  (Oct 95)</p>
<p> copper (thousand tonnes)	1,795	1,678	 1,455</p>
<p> lead-zinc				74	   72	    56</p>
<p> bauxite				  50	   20	    24</p>
<p>NON-FERROUS METAL PRODUCTION</p>
<p> electrolytic copper (tonnes) 10,128     10,025	 5,599</p>
<p> refined lead			2,490	1,165	 1,620</p>
<p> zinc				  3,925	2,298	   128</p>
<p> aluminium ingots		  3,106	3,364	 2,572</p>
<p> refined silver (kilos)	  5,336	2,712	   705</p>
<p>-- Beti Bilandzic, 381 11 222 43 05 Belgrade newsroom</p>
</text>
